    "message": "docs: documentation update plan v2 \u2014 freshness, drift, telemetry, diagrams (#12233)\n\n## Summary\n\nFull execution of the documentation update plan (v2.0, governance doc\nincluded\nin this branch):\n\n- **Archive hygiene**: 348 issue-mirror drafts/packs + 936 unreferenced\nworking\nreports moved to `docs/99-archive/` (`git mv`, history preserved). Every\nissue/PR ref was verified CLOSED/MERGED against GitHub before archiving;\nretention-sensitive evidence (165 `closeout_evidence` files, 41\ngate-referenced\n  baselines, curated `docs/reports`) deliberately kept.\n- **Freshness-hold clearance**: all **143 triaged defects** in\n`freshness-hold-2026-09-25.md` resolved \u2014 canonical class renames\napplied to\n  `.mmd`/`.mermaid` sources *and* description cards, contract versions\n  (Gold v2.0), budgets (330 edges, 38 view families), paths\n  (`medallion/` package, `config/` package, `domain/ports/noop/`),\nretired surfaces marked (`bioetl-runtime`, `bioetl-provider-health-v2`),\n  15 ADR stale paths corrected. Hold registry: 0 open entries.\n- **July re-verification wave**: 41 published docs semantically\nre-verified and\nstamped `2026-10-15` \u2014 key fixes: `data-layers.md` Silver provenance\nprefix\nfields (`_run_id` et al. ARE persisted via `column_groups.system`),\nRF-007.1\nfail-fast semantics documented in `domain-composite.md`, adr-matrix\nextended\n  to ADR-062.\n- **Process**: PR template gains a docs-freshness checklist item\n  (`Last verified` + regen `--check` discipline).\n\n## Scope safety\n\n- `reports/` working-tree baselines read by debt gates verified intact\n  (all 13 gate-input paths re-checked).\n- `docs/reports/` curated tree, `bioetl-env-cache-*`, retention evidence\n  untouched.\n- Only doc/runtime surfaces: no `src/` behavior changes, no `.env`\nedits,\n  no monitoring services started (ADR-010).\n\n## Verification\n\n- `check-links` \u2014 OK (incl. `--legacy-paths --legacy-paths-all`)\n- `generate-cleanup-inventory --update/--check` \u2014 synchronized\n- `check_skills_mirror.sh --check` \u2014 mirror contract OK\n- `check_no_partial_tree --base origin/main --tip HEAD` \u2014 no partial\ncommits\n- `scripts.diagrams lint` on edited `.mmd`/`.mermaid` \u2014 clean\n(pre-existing\n  failures elsewhere untouched)\n- `generate_adr_registry`, `report_docs_kpi`,\n`generate_pipeline_dataflows --check` \u2014 all current\n- 2 foreign memory-repair commits were rebased out; branch = 11\ndocs-only\n  commits on current `origin/main`\n\n#### Test plan\n\n- [x] `python -m scripts.docs check-links` \u2192 all checks passed\n- [x] `python -m scripts.docs generate-cleanup-inventory --check` \u2192\nsynchronized\n- [x] `bash scripts/ai/codex/check_skills_mirror.sh --check` \u2192 OK\n- [x] `python scripts/engineering/repo/check_no_partial_tree.py` \u2192 clean\n- [ ] CI `docs.yml` link-check job green on this branch\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: codex <codex@local>\nCo-authored-by: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
